<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>纽约时报 &amp;gt; 美国 &amp;gt; 政治</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/spotlight/on-politics</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 22:29:44 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>他们是久经考验的民主党人。选民关心吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/07/us/politics/angie-craig-haley-stevens-democrats.html</link><description>2018 年，海莉·史蒂文斯 (Haley Stevens) 和安吉·克雷格 (Angie Craig) 受到民主党人的赞扬。今年，他们面临着艰难的初选。</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 22:29:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/07/us/politics/angie-craig-haley-stevens-democrats.html</guid></item><item><title>阿卜杜勒·赛义德能否在大选前团结密歇根州民主党人？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/us/politics/el-sayed-michigan-skeptical-voters.html</link><description>他的微弱优势可能预示着未来的挑战。</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 17:35:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/us/politics/el-sayed-michigan-skeptical-voters.html</guid></item><item><title>密歇根州民主党参议院初选已成为该党夏季最丑陋的竞选</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/03/us/politics/michigan-democratic-senate-primary-race-ideology.html</link><description>民主党参议院初选将使守旧派与崛起的联盟展开对决。</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 21:10:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/03/us/politics/michigan-democratic-senate-primary-race-ideology.html</guid></item><item><title>中期选举升温，民主党人担心什么</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/democrats-primary-elections-midterms.html</link><description>民主党有很多事情进展顺利。这就是可能出错的地方。</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 22:02:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/democrats-primary-elections-midterms.html</guid></item><item><title>特朗普在任期间赚了数十亿美元。他的政党会付出政治代价吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/29/us/politics/trump-personal-wealth.html</link><description>总统去年在任期间的收入达到惊人的 22 亿美元。民主党人希望将其作为中期选举的竞选议题。</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 22:03:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/29/us/politics/trump-personal-wealth.html</guid></item><item><title>缅因州民主党迎来了一位新的工人阶级英雄：特洛伊·杰克逊。他能交付吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/27/us/politics/troy-jackson-maine-senate-democrats.html</link><description>前伐木工特洛伊·杰克逊面临着击倒苏珊·柯林斯的艰巨任务。</description><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:59:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/27/us/politics/troy-jackson-maine-senate-democrats.html</guid></item><item><title>夏季与伊朗的战争如何影响秋季选举</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/us/politics/republicans-trump-iran-war-midterms.html</link><description>特朗普总统和共和党人似乎无法摆脱冲突的政治影响。</description><pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 21:21:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/us/politics/republicans-trump-iran-war-midterms.html</guid></item><item><title>左派的下一个重大考验：密歇根州、威斯康星州和明尼苏达州</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/22/us/politics/progressives-michigan-wisconsin-minnesota.html</link><description>进步人士现在正在紫色或浅蓝色州的更不稳定的地形中战斗。</description><pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 21:00:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/22/us/politics/progressives-michigan-wisconsin-minnesota.html</guid></item><item><title>涉及马克·兰姆的性丑闻在亚利桑那州共和党众议院初选中会重要吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/20/us/politics/arizona-house-primary-lamb.html</link><description>在该州宗教信仰深厚的地区举行的竞选是对特朗普支持力量的考验。</description><pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 22:28:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/20/us/politics/arizona-house-primary-lamb.html</guid></item><item><title>谁真正拥有 2026 年中期现金优势？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/17/us/politics/democrats-republicans-midterms-cash.html</link><description>筹款竞赛比看上去更加激烈。</description><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 21:31:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/17/us/politics/democrats-republicans-midterms-cash.html</guid></item></channel></rss>